      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Lightning Visionary could attack for 2 unblocked damage. The opponent's only creature (Turntimber Basilisk) has summoning sickness and cannot block, and all opponent's lands are tapped so no combat tricks are possible. This is risk-free damage.",
      "action_taken": "Did not attack with Lightning Visionary",
      "better_line": "Attack with Lightning Visionary for 2 free damage, then proceed to second main phase to play Mountain and cast spells.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 50,
