      "decision_index": 47,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Passed with 3 mana available and Master's Rebuke in hand, missing the chance to kill Lightning Visionary (2/1) with Turntimber Basilisk's 2 power via Master's Rebuke. This would have cleared the only blocker, allowing Basilisk to attack freely. Without removing it, the Basilisk can't attack profitably since it would trade with the Visionary in combat.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without casting anything in precombat main phase.",
      "better_line": "Cast Master's Rebuke targeting Turntimber Basilisk and Lightning Visionary to kill the Visionary, then attack with the unblocked Basilisk for 2 damage.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 56,
      "player": "GPT53C Teach",
      "decision_index": 54,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Turntimber Basilisk (2/1 deathtouch) has a favorable attack into Lightning Visionary (2/1). If blocked, the trade eliminates the opponent's only creature (deathtouch ensures the kill regardless of prowess pump). If unblocked, it deals 2 damage. The Basilisk isn't needed on defense since the Visionary won't profitably attack into deathtouch. Additionally, GPT53C has Master's Rebuke and Hunter's Insight in hand as potential combat tricks with 3 mana available.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to attack with Turntimber Basilisk.",
      "better_line": "Attack with Turntimber Basilisk. If blocked by Lightning Visionary, the favorable trade removes the opponent's only creature. If unblocked, deal 2 damage. Could also hold up Hunter's Insight (2G) to potentially draw cards if unblocked, or Master's Rebuke (1G) to remove the Visionary.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 56,
      "player": "GPT53C Teach",
      "decision_index": 54,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Turntimber Basilisk has deathtouch and trample (from Garruk's +1), so blocking with a 1/1 token only saves 1 life (4 trample damage instead of 5). The Goblin Wizard token with prowess has future value — o3 Memoir has Thrill of Possibility and Goblin Wizardry in the graveyard suggesting a noncreature-spell-heavy deck that makes prowess tokens worth more than 1 life at 20 life.",
      "action_taken": "Blocked Turntimber Basilisk with a 1/1 Goblin Wizard token, saving 1 life but losing the token.",
      "better_line": "Don't block — take 5 damage (going to 15) and preserve both prowess tokens for future attacks. At 20 life, 1 point saved is worth less than a prowess creature that could deal more damage over subsequent turns.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 101,
      "player": "o3 Memoir",
      "decision_index": 91,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Hunter's Insight while Garruk's +1 ability is still on the stack means the opponent can respond by killing the 2/1 Turntimber Basilisk before it gets the +3/+3 buff. The Basilisk at 1 toughness dies to any burn spell. If the opponent has even a Shock or similar, both Hunter's Insight and the Garruk activation are wasted.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Hunter's Insight in response to Garruk's +1 ability (while Basilisk is still 2/1)",
      "better_line": "Let Garruk's +1 resolve first, making Basilisk a 5/4 with trample, then cast Hunter's Insight in the precombat main phase. The 5/4 body is much harder to remove with burn, protecting the Hunter's Insight investment.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 136,
      "player": "GPT53C Teach",
      "decision_index": 124,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Pillar of Flame targeted Turntimber Basilisk instead of Garruk, Unleashed. Garruk at 4 loyalty is the primary threat on the board, generating card advantage and tokens every turn. Dealing 2 to Garruk would bring it to 2 loyalty, making it very vulnerable to being attacked down next turn by Kinetic Augur (which would have 3 power after Pillar goes to graveyard) or the Goblin token. The Basilisk is only a 2/1 and less threatening than an active planeswalker.",
      "action_taken": "Targeted Turntimber Basilisk with Pillar of Flame, killing it",
