      "decision_index": 144,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Cast Ranger's Guile in response to the opponent's Kinetic Augur ETB draw trigger, which doesn't threaten any of GPT53C Teach's creatures. The +1/+1 and hexproof are completely unnecessary here - there's nothing to protect against. This wastes a card that could later save a key creature (like Garruk's Harbinger or Rampaging Baloths) from removal.",
