    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "By targeting Garruk with all 3 damage from Flames of the Firebrand instead of dealing 3 to the opponent's face, the player missed the opportunity to reduce Chandra's Incinerator's cost by 3 (to {2}{R}), enabling casting the 6/6 trampler this same turn with the remaining 3 mana. A 6/6 trampler on board is a massive threat that could race the opponent, and Incinerator's triggered ability would let future pings (e.g. Chandra's Magmutt) also deal damage to Garruk or other creatures.",
