      "description": "Used Hunter's Edge (4 mana, a card) to kill a sick Chandra's Magmutt that couldn't block or attack this turn, when the Turntimber Basilisk already had deathtouch and +3/+3 from Garruk. This wasted a card and 4 mana for minimal value, leaving only 3 mana for deploying threats instead of 7.",
