    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "With 7 life facing 12 damage (Turntimber Basilisk 3/2, Garruk's Harbinger 7/6 trample, Elemental Token 2/2), only blocking the Basilisk with Young Pyromancer leaves 9 unblocked damage — lethal. Living Lightning (3/2) could also block despite being 'sick' (summoning sickness doesn't prevent blocking). Assigning Living Lightning to block the 7/6 trampling Harbinger would reduce trample damage to 4, bringing total to 4+2=6, surviving at 1 life. Living Lightning's death trigger would also return an instant/sorcery from graveyard.",
